<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{view.mode === 'demo'}}" class="demo">模拟管理台 · 退款按钮只改变演示状态，不调用真实支付</view><view class="eyebrow">CAMP WORKSPACE</view><view class="title">把陪伴，做到每一周。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error gap" bindtap="retry">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取管理数据…</view><view wx:if="{{view && !view.isAdmin}}" class="card">需要管理员权限，普通成员无法访问管理数据。</view>
  <block wx:if="{{view.isAdmin}}">
    <view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="section-title">周报与成员情况</view><text class="tag">{{view.today}}</text></view><picker range="{{periods}}" value="{{periodChoice}}" bindchange="choosePeriod"><view class="picker">{{periods[periodChoice]}}　⌄</view></picker><view class="row gap"><view class="metric"><view class="metric-number">{{view.admin.count}}</view><view class="metric-label">入营人数</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="metric-number">{{view.admin.qualifiedCount}}/{{view.admin.assessedCount}}</view><view class="metric-label">截至当前已满足条件</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="metric-number">{{view.admin.rate === null ? '—' : view.admin.rate + '%'}}</view><view class="metric-label">截至当前达标率</view></view></view><view class="note">待处理申请暂不计考核分母；尚未开始的周期不计考核。身体变化有至少两次记录的成员：{{view.admin.weightCount}}人。</view><button class="secondary small-button gap" bindtap="exportCsv">复制本周期统计CSV（不含健康问卷）</button></view>
    <view wx:for="{{view.admin.members}}" wx:key="userId" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="section-title">{{item.nickname}}</view><text class="badge">{{item.pending ? '申请待处理' : item.period}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.camp}} · 有效{{item.valid}}/{{item.required}}天</view><view class="week"><view wx:for="{{item.rows}}" wx:for-item="day" wx:key="date" class="day"><view>{{day.short}}</view><view class="dot {{day.status}}">{{day.symbol}}</view></view></view><view class="row gap compact"><text>可返 ¥{{item.eligible}} · 已退 ¥{{item.refunded}}</text><text>体重变化 {{item.changeKg === null ? '未形成趋势' : item.changeKg + 'kg'}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="section-title">周期结算与退款</view><view class="muted">已结束周期才可结算；未处理申请会暂缓相关成员结算。规则：900元总上限，无额外奖金。</view><button class="primary gap" data-action="settle" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="action">结算所有已结束周期</button><view wx:if="{{view.mode === 'demo'}}" class="admin-grid gap"><button class="secondary small-button" data-action="processRefunds" bindtap="action">模拟发起退款</button><button class="secondary small-button" data-action="confirmRefunds" bindtap="action">模拟确认到账</button></view><view wx:for="{{view.admin.refunds}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row row"><view>{{item.nickname}} · {{item.periodIndex === 12 ? '结营6天' : '第' + (item.periodIndex + 1) + '周'}}<view class="muted">{{item.statusLabel}}{{item.mode === 'demo' ? ' · 模拟' : ''}}</view></view><text>¥{{item.amount}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="section-title">心得与举报审核</view><view wx:if="{{!view.admin.posts.length && !view.admin.reports.length}}" class="muted">暂无待处理内容。</view><view wx:for="{{view.admin.posts}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row"><view>{{item.nickname}} · {{item.status === 'pending' ? '待审核' : '已隐藏'}}</view><view class="post-text">{{item.text}}</view><view class="row gap"><button class="secondary small-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-status="approved" bindtap="moderate">通过</button><button class="danger small-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-status="rejected" bindtap="moderate">不通过</button></view></view><view wx:for="{{view.admin.reports}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row"><view>举报：{{item.reason}}</view><view class="note break">内容编号 {{item.postId}}</view><button class="danger small-button gap" data-id="{{item.postId}}" data-status="hidden" bindtap="moderate">隐藏被举报内容并结案</button></view></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="section-title">申请与异常处理</view><view wx:if="{{!view.admin.requests.length}}" class="muted">暂无待处理申请。</view><view wx:for="{{view.admin.requests}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row"><view>{{item.nickname}} · {{item.type}}</view><view class="note">{{item.reason}}</view><button class="secondary small-button gap" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="resolve">记录沟通与处理结果</button></view><view class="note">此入口仅记录沟通结果，不进行医疗放行、自动延期或特殊退款；需要的后续安排由运营人员依法另行处理。</view></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="section-title">期次与规则</view><view wx:for="{{view.admin.camps}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.startDate}}开营 · {{item.rulesVersion}}</view></view><view class="note">首版只读展示。营规已绑定订单快照，不允许临时修改已报名成员的领奖门槛。</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{view.mode === 'demo'}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">演示时间工具</view><view class="muted">只推进本机演示业务日期，便于查看周期结束及结算。推进不能撤销，可在“我的”重置。</view><view class="admin-grid gap"><button class="plain small-button" data-days="1" bindtap="advance">推进1天</button><button class="plain small-button" data-days="7" bindtap="advance">推进7天</button><button class="plain small-button" data-days="90" bindtap="advance">推进90天</button></view></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="section-title">最近操作记录</view><view wx:for="{{view.admin.audits}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row compact break"><view>{{item.action}} · {{item.detail}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.at}}</view></view></view>
  </block>
</view>
